    "bubble_choice_description": "Add a count message, a filter summary label, and a friendly empty state to a showtimes list.",
    "long_instructions": "## Movie Showtime\r\n\r\n**Goal:**\r\nEnhance the movie showtimes view with clear **transparency cues** so users always know what they're seeing, what filters are active, and what happens when nothing matches.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Open `script.js`.**\r\n   Find the `render()` function. This is where the movie list is built.\r\n\r\n2. **Add three messages to improve clarity:**\r\n\r\n   * **Count message:**\r\n     Update `#countMessage` to show how many results are displayed out of the total.\r\n     Example: `Showing 3 of 6 results`\r\n   * **Filter label:**\r\n     Update `#filterLabel` to summarize the rule being used.\r\n     Example: `Filter: showtimes after 6 PM`\r\n   * **Empty-state message:**\r\n     If no results match, show a friendly message in `#emptyMessage`, such as:\r\n\r\n     > “No showtimes found for this selection.”\r\n     > Otherwise, hide it.\r\n\r\n3. **Test your work.**\r\n\r\n4. **Use AI to check your reasoning:**\r\n\r\n   * \"Explain what my loop is doing each time it runs.\"\r\n   * \"Check if my count message still works when there are no results.\"\r\n   * \"Suggest a friendlier way to say 'No results found.'\"\r\n\r\n",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>CineGo — Movie Showtimes</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <main class=\"app\">\n    <header class=\"top-bar\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"brand\">CineGo</p>\n        <h1>Movie Showtimes</h1>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"profile-button\" type=\"button\">CG</button>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero-card\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Tonight near you</p>\n      <h2>Find a showtime that fits your evening.</h2>\n      <div class=\"search-row\">\n        <span>📍 CodeTown Cinema</span>\n        <span>Today</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"filter-panel\" aria-label=\"Current filter\">\n      <p id=\"filterLabel\"></p>\n      <p id=\"countMessage\"></p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section aria-label=\"Movie showtimes\">\n      <ul id=\"movieList\"></ul>\n      <p id=\"emptyMessage\"></p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: #101114;\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.app {\n  max-width: 430px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  background: #17191f;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n.top-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  color: #ffcc33;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.profile-button {\n  width: 42px;\n  height: 42px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: none;\n  background: #2a2d36;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.hero-card {\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 204, 51, 0.22), rgba(255, 85, 85, 0.16)),\n    #242733;\n  border: 1px solid #343847;\n  border-radius: 22px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  color: #ffcc33;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.hero-card h2 {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0 0 18px;\n}\n\n.search-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.search-row span {\n  background: #111318;\n  border: 1px solid #383d4c;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.filter-panel {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 10px;\n  background: #20232c;\n  border: 1px solid #343847;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.filter-panel p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n#filterLabel {\n  color: #ffcc33;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n#countMessage {\n  color: #b8beca;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n#movieList {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.movie-card,\n#movieList li {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  color: #111827;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);\n}\n\n.movie-card h2 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n}\n\n.movie-time {\n  color: #4b5563;\n  margin: 0 0 14px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.movie-card button {\n  width: 100%;\n  background: #ffcc33;\n  color: #111827;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.movie-card button:hover {\n  background: #ffd95c;\n}\n\n.movie-card button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n#emptyMessage {\n  color: #b8beca;\n  background: #20232c;\n  border: 1px dashed #4b5563;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-style: italic;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// --- Sample data (toggle to test) ---\nconst movies = [\n  { title: \"Moon Harbor\", time: \"6:15 PM\" },\n  { title: \"Granite Peak\", time: \"7:00 PM\" },\n  { title: \"Neon River\", time: \"9:10 PM\" }\n];\n\nfunction render() {\n  const list = document.getElementById(\"movieList\");\n  const countMessage = document.getElementById(\"countMessage\");\n  const filterLabel = document.getElementById(\"filterLabel\");\n  const emptyMessage = document.getElementById(\"emptyMessage\");\n\n  list.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n  const results = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < movies.length; i++) {\n    const movie = movies[i];\n\n    if (movie.time >= \"6:00 PM\") {\n      results.push(movie);\n      list.appendChild(createCard(movie));\n    }\n  }\n\n\n\n  \n}\n\nrender();",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "function createCard(movie) {\n  const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n  li.className = \"movie-card\";\n\n  const title = document.createElement(\"h2\");\n  title.textContent = movie.title;\n\n  const time = document.createElement(\"p\");\n  time.className = \"movie-time\";\n  time.textContent = \"Showtime: \" + movie.time;\n\n  const button = document.createElement(\"button\");\n  button.type = \"button\";\n  button.textContent = \"Choose seats\";\n\n  li.appendChild(title);\n  li.appendChild(time);\n  li.appendChild(button);\n\n  return li;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
